{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前「超人」亨利卡菲爾（Henry Cavill）今晚現身中環卑利街，夥拍《殺神John Wick》導演Chad Stahelski拍攝全新奇幻動作電影《Highlander》。劇組搭</p><p>前「超人」亨利卡菲爾（Henry Cavill）今晚現身中環卑利街，夥拍《殺神John Wick》導演Chad Stahelski拍攝全新奇幻動作電影《Highlander》。</p><figure><img alt=\"Henry Cavill驚喜現身中環拍戲！（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164752727348482048631580.jpeg/BDrpqrk-KMBFO75EbblVHxy282abzV2chjnS_7w50v8\"/><figcaption>Henry Cavill驚喜現身中環拍戲！（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Henry Cavill驚喜現身中環拍戲！（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164752723929993216394601.jpeg/yLv3SUHToc0ECyaAnT1X6k80RWENgO4Es2gXO4loFzs\"/><figcaption>Henry Cavill驚喜現身中環拍戲！（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164752720628944896460195.jpeg/Ux4tXWcjnn80fnlmH-s9AUb3aZ10lhgkPVOkgQdTpIE\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164752717080432640592401.jpeg/m2wS-SRxSbwqntAQHiHboDmi6bvEFEjHGF_fuCJf37g\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><p>劇組搭建懷舊霓虹燈街景</p><p>留了一頭曲髮的亨利身穿啡色皮䄛進行拍攝，劇組在中環搭建了臨時寺廟、霓虹燈牌、大排檔、糖水檔等特色街景，現場吸引不少民眾圍觀。根據現場環境，似乎正拍攝元旦倒數慶祝活動，而年份是2040年。</p><figure><img alt=\"劇組搭建懷舊霓虹燈街景。（關穎賢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164753661701001216295467.jpeg/o6CG912vYwCtoE2HGBZPD02Hz3TtQrGebcTXHFfE1xw\"/><figcaption>劇組搭建懷舊霓虹燈街景。（關穎賢攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劇組臨時寺廟、霓虹燈牌、大排檔、糖水檔等特色街景。（關穎賢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164753659180093440256419.jpeg/LsbYZKKJZh7srA9h7QrZHMleVMpO39ZnFc0wNS_NMDU\"/><figcaption>劇組臨時寺廟、霓虹燈牌、大排檔、糖水檔等特色街景。（關穎賢攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劇組臨時寺廟、霓虹燈牌、大排檔、糖水檔等特色街景。（關穎賢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164753656701128704246389.jpeg/PuogOnVvvgOFjkBv3ISTnV2QyZIXB7RJH2sHuCVrB7g\"/><figcaption>劇組臨時寺廟、霓虹燈牌、大排檔、糖水檔等特色街景。（關穎賢攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劇組臨時寺廟、霓虹燈牌、大排檔、糖水檔等特色街景。（關穎賢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164753654213775360826749.jpeg/x5aG3jHsDNqLQLDUWz5m6KXhISE2K8w8Lyz5FxUs-Rc\"/><figcaption>劇組臨時寺廟、霓虹燈牌、大排檔、糖水檔等特色街景。（關穎賢攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T18:14:22.915320+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":471,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}